\" and subcategory \"Geometry\".\n\n- **Inputs:** `Curve` and `Count` (integer, default 10).\n- **Outputs:** `Points` (list of points) and `Length` (total curve length).\n- **Errors:** a null curve or a `Count` below 1 throws, so Grasshopper shows an error and outputs nothing.\n\nChoices I made:\n- **Point count:** \"N equal segments\" is implemented as N+1 points including both ends, which matches Grasshopper's own Divide Curve component. If you want N points instead, that is a one-line change.\n- **Method name:** the method is `DivideCurveStats`, with the display name \"Divide Curve Stats\", so saved-file GUIDs are derived from that name.\n\nThe build also copies `BenchPlugin.dll` into `%AppData%\\Grasshopper\\Libraries\\Betta\\` through the project's post-build event, as it already did before this change. I have not loaded the component in Grasshopper to check it visually.","ttft_ms":1979,"type":"result","duration_ms":30919,"uuid":"19645823-a1cf-415d-8a14-b855b1c869a8","ttft_stream_ms":1758,"time_to_request_ms":447,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":6,"system_prompt":87,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":9,"input_attachments":44,"input_hooks":4,"conversation_append":1,"tool_pool_refresh":5,"init_message":157,"init_frame_send":10,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":11,"message_prep":2,"model_config_wait":2,"autocompact":3,"request_announcements":13,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":52,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":14,"request_build":21},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":229,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":453,"time_to_request_major_faults":9870,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"skill_listing","slowest_producer_ms":8,"cpu_ms":46,"major_faults":651,"setup_ms":6,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":9,"ambient_wait_ms":8,"render_ms":18,"producers":43,"token_counts":0},"tool_schema_build_detail":{"betas_ms":1,"waits_ms":1,"placement_ms":9,"render_ms":40,"after_ms":1,"other_m